{"4738020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drink Factory Simulator - Prologue", "steam_appid": 4738020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras/820a963dbaa03c398cb7fb57ea31c25b.poster.avif?t=1786622083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras/820a963dbaa03c398cb7fb57ea31c25b.webm?t=1786622083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras/820a963dbaa03c398cb7fb57ea31c25b.mp4?t=1786622083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink Factory Simulator is a detailed simulation game where you build your own beverage empire, develop recipes, and manage a massive production facility. 🍹 Start with a small mixer, discover the right blends, expand your production line, and fulfill your customers' orders on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Drink Factory Simulator, you decide the formula of your drinks. 🧪 Adjust each ingredient's ratio yourself, test it and find the perfect recipe. Wrong ratio means a low score, right ratio means big profit. 💰</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras/bdfa9d59011cec12a1966e492801c204.poster.avif?t=1786622083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras/bdfa9d59011cec12a1966e492801c204.webm?t=1786622083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras/bdfa9d59011cec12a1966e492801c204.mp4?t=1786622083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🔬 Discover and Develop Recipes – Experiment with soda, cola, energy drinks and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🏭 Expand and Manage Your Factory – Go from a small mixer to massive automated production facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 📦 Fulfill Orders on Time – Boost customer satisfaction with quality production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🧪 Analysis and Experiment Mode – Test your recipes, see which ingredients are correct and which are wrong</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras/bd203343c546362857232417bccf2422.poster.avif?t=1786622083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras/bd203343c546362857232417bccf2422.webm?t=1786622083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras/bd203343c546362857232417bccf2422.mp4?t=1786622083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔬 Discover and Develop Recipes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover soda, cola, energy drinks and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find the right ratio, earn high scores and land big orders.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏭 Expand and Manage Your Factory</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Buy new machines and improve your production line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Go from a small mixer to massive automated facilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras/fb9ef43fcba4bb267320aba01b0670e3.avif?t=1786622083\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras_big/fb9ef43fcba4bb267320aba01b0670e3.avif?t=1786622083 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📦 Order System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fulfill your customers' demands on time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Boost customer satisfaction with quality production.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧪 Analysis and Experiment Mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Test your recipes, see which ingredients are correct and which are wrong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover the perfect beverages through trial and error.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💼 Economy and Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your money wisely, unlock new recipes and expand your factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✅ WHY SHOULD YOU ADD THIS TO YOUR WISHLIST?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deep recipe trial-and-error system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Factory management and production line simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A constantly growing beverage empire</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎉 Ready to build your own beverage empire?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 Add to your wishlist now and be among the first to try it at launch!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras/820a963dbaa03c398cb7fb57ea31c25b.poster.avif?t=1786622083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras/820a963dbaa03c398cb7fb5