s are correct and which are wrong</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras/bd203343c546362857232417bccf2422.poster.avif?t=1786622083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras/bd203343c546362857232417bccf2422.webm?t=1786622083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras/bd203343c546362857232417bccf2422.mp4?t=1786622083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔬 Discover and Develop Recipes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover soda, cola, energy drinks and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find the right ratio, earn high scores and land big orders.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏭 Expand and Manage Your Factory</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Buy new machines and improve your production line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Go from a small mixer to massive automated facilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras/fb9ef43fcba4bb267320aba01b0670e3.avif?t=1786622083\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738020/extras_big/fb9ef43fcba4bb267320aba01b0670e3.avif?t=1786622083 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📦 Order System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fulfill your customers' demands on time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Boost customer satisfaction with quality production.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧪 Analysis and Experiment Mode</h2><ul 